  "title": "05/18/2026 – Precision Optics to Participate in the Lytham Partners Spring 2026 Investor Conference on May 28, 2026",
  "summary": "LITTLETON, Mass., May 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. (Nasdaq: POCI) (the “Company”), a leading designer and manufacturer of advanced optical instruments for the medical and defense/aerospace industries, will participate in a webcast presentation and host one-on-one meetings with investors at the Lytham Partners Spring 2026 Investor Conference, taking place virtually on […]",
